  "body": "I noticed a \"must\" in a note was added in https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/2330/files#diff-36cd38f49b9afa08222c0dc9ebfe35ebR17679 and then found a whole bunch more with a regexp search.\r\n\r\n```\r\n class=[\"']?(note|example).+(\\n.+)*\\b(should|must|may|optional|recomm)\r\n```\r\n\r\nWe could maybe add a lint check for this also...",
